    <DataNode elementId="AT1G06520-MONOMER" textLabel="AT1G06520-MONOMER" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="AT1G06520-MONOMER" dataSource="plantcyc" />
      <Graphics centerX="150" centerY="515" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">GPAT1 encodes a membrane-associated mitochondrial localized protein with glycerol-3-phosphate acyltransferase activity, based on genetic complementation of a yeast mutant |CITS: [12897259]|. The transcript is expressed in flower buds, siliques, leaves, and roots based on Northern blots |CITS: [12897259]| and it has been associated with several tissues via microarray expression analysis, as well |CITS: [15806101]|. Homozygous mutant &lt;i&gt;gpat1&lt;/i&gt; plants are male sterile due to aberrant tapetal degradation and pollen development. These mutants also have abnormal glycerolipid levels |CITS: [12897259]|. Substrate specificity assays in yeast extracts demonstrated that GPAT1 seems to be quite specific for |FRAME:GLYCEROL-3P| (G-3-P) because the levels of G-3-P acylation do not show any reduction when dihydroxyacetone phosphate, lysophosphatidic acid, or sterols are added to the reaction mixture. In contrast the enzyme appears to accept several different saturated and unsaturated acyl:CoA donors. In the absence of 5 mM EDTA in the reaction mixture, the highest levels of |FRAME: GLYCEROL-3P| acylation occured in the presence of |FRAME: CPD-10269 C16:1-CoA| and |FRAME: OLEOYL-COA C18:1-CoA|. However, in the presence of 5 mM EDTA, the acyl-donor preference shifted and |FRAME: STEAROYL-COA C18:0-CoA| was the best substrate |CITS: [12897259]|.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="AT1G06520-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="Catalyzes" value="RXN-12442" />
      <Property key="GOTerms" value="GO:0005739, GO:0005789, GO:0005792" />
      <Property key="Accession1" value="AT1G06520.1" />
      <Property key="EnzymeNotUsedIn" value="PWYQT-4482, PWY0-1319" />
      <Property key="Gene" value="AT1G06520" />
      <Property key="^citations" value="12897259:EV-EXP-IDA:3541786020:kate, 12897259:EV-EXP-TAS:3541786529:kate, 12897259:EV-EXP-IDA:3541786535:kate" />
      <Property key="InstanceNameTemplate" value="MONOMER-*" />
      <Property key="Locations" value="CCI-MIT-PL, CCO-ER-MEM" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation_PUB_12897259" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation_PUB_15806101" />
    </DataNode>
